TV, is the largest and asset light proxy play to the growing residential demand story of India. One of the few Indian start ups to taste global success with presence in 100+ cities across 9 countries, Square Yards is at the forefront of tech adoption in the sector, with multiple patents across VR/AI domains.\n\n![SQUAREYARDS ANDROID APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/google-play.png)\n![SQUAREYARDS IOS APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/app-store.png)\n![loader](/assets/images/loader3-big.gif)","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.magicbricks.com/project-dhruv-tara-chs-for-sale-in-mumbai-pppfs","title":"Flats for Sale near Dhruv Tara CHS, Mumbai - Flats Price near Dhruv Tara CHS","raw_content":"# Flats for Sale near Dhruv Tara CHS, Borivali East, Mumbai\n\n![3BHK Multistorey Apartment for New Property in Rustomjee Summit at Borivali East](https://img.staticmb.com/mbphoto/property/cropped_images/2026/Sep/06/Photo_h180_w240/5757_1788700854365.3481_180_240.jpg \"3BHK Multistorey Apartment for New Property in Rustomjee Summit at Borivali East\")\n\n## 3 BHK Flat for Sale in Borivali East Mumbai\n\nYou can find this 3 BHK flat for sale in Borivali East, Mumbai.This property is housed in the Rustomjee Summit society. Available at price of ₹3.80 Cr, this ready to move flat in Borivali East is an excellent choice. The flat is placed on 25 floor encompassing carpet area 1207 sqft. The building has 45 floor and contains Kids play area, Kids Play Pool With Water Slides. This property is equipped with power back up, reserved parking, security, service/goods lift, visitor parking. P51800003590 is the RERA number of the project. Property rates in Rustomjee Summit fall within ₹2.35 Cr - ₹4.03 Cr, with multiple 2,3 bhk flats options.    [View Property](/propertyDetails/3-BHK-1207-Sq-ft-Multistorey-Apartment-FOR-Sale-Borivali-East-in-Mumbai&id=4d423836333339393935)\n\n![4BHK Multistorey Apartment for New Property in CCI Rivali Park Skyleap at Borivali