 in Borivali East is available at a cost of ₹5.23 Cr. The possession date of this apartment is Jun '30. The property is on 43 floor and has carpet area 1388 sqft. The building has 54 floor and contains Wheelchair Accessibility. The apartment is provided with power back up, reserved parking, security, service/goods lift, air conditioned, visitor parking, intercom facility. The project is RERA approved and PR1183032501382 is the RERA number of the society. The pricing in Cci Rivali Park Skyleap varies from ₹2.23 Cr - ₹4.10 Cr, offering units in 2,3 bhk flats configurations.   Nearby Landmark: Near Magathane Metro Station Off Western Express Highway.   [View Property](/propertyDetails/3-BHK-1788-Sq-ft-Multistorey-Apartment-FOR-Sale-Borivali-East-in-Mumbai&id=4d423836333632343631)\n\n![4BHK Multistorey Apartment for New Property in CCI Rivali Park Skyleap at Borivali East](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"4BHK Multistorey Apartment for New Property in CCI Rivali Park Skyleap at Borivali East\")\n\n## 4 BHK Flat for Sale in Borivali East Mumbai\n\nRivali Park Skyleap offers ultraluxurious residences with breathtaking views of Sanjay Gandhi National Park and the Mumbai skyline. Enjoy spacious living, sky lounges, landscaped podiums, a modern gym, and premium lifestyle amenities. Ideally located near Western Express Highway, Magathane Metro Station, malls, schools, and hospitalsan iconic address for luxury living in Borivali East.  Nearby Landmark: Near Magathane Metro Station, Off Western Express Highway.   [View Property](/propertyDetails/4-BHK-2500-Sq-ft-Multistorey-Apartment-FOR-Sale-Borivali-East-in-Mumbai&id=4d423836333631383037)\n\n![4BHK Multistorey Apartment for Resale in Oberoi Sky City at Borivali East](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"4BHK Multistorey Apartment for Resale in Oberoi Sky City at Borivali East\")\n\n## 4 BHK Flat for Sale in Borivali East Mumbai\n\nYou can find this 4 BHK flat for sale in Borivali East, Mumbai.Located in Oberoi Sky City, this flat is equi