Price 1.90 Cr. Onwards\n\n2 BHK Flats / Apartments\n\n* [Overview](#pdOverview)\n* [Property for Sale / Rent](#pdPropertiesforSale)\n* [Unit Configuration](#pdPriceRange)\n* [Amenities](#pdAminities)\n* [Gallery](#projectGallery)\n* [More](javascript:void(0);) \n  + [About Builder](#pdAboutBuilderProject)\n\nDhruv Tara Chs 1.90 Cr. (Onwards) Flats / Apartments\n\n* ![](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/pf-img1.jpg)\n\n  Property Type  \n\n  Flats / Apartments\n* ![](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/pf-img2.jpg)\n\n  Configuration  \n\n  2 BHK\n* ![](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/pf-img13.jpg)\n\n  Area of Flats / Apartments  \n\n  725 Sq.ft.\n* ![](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/pf-img3.jpg)\n\n  Pricing  \n\n  1.90 Cr.\n* ![](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/pf-img4.jpg)\n\n  Possession  \n\n  Jan 2001\n* ![](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/pf-img5.jpg)\n\n  Total Units  \n\n  80 units\n* ![](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/pf-img6.jpg)\n\n  Total Towers  \n\n  2\n* ![](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/pf-img7.jpg)\n\n  Total Area  \n\n  2 Acre\n* ![](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/pf-img9.jpg)\n\n  Possession Status  \n\n  Ready to Move\n\n## Properties in Dhruv Tara Chs\n\n* Buy\n* Rent\n\n![](https://dynamic.realestateindia.com/prop_images/wh1/1041067/1041388_1.jpeg)\n\n[2 BHK 725 Sq.ft. Apartment for Sale in Dhruv Tara Chs](https://www.realestateindia.com/property-detail/2bkh-flats-apartments-for-sale-in-ashok-van-dahisar-east-mumbai-1-90-cr-1041388.htm)\n\nAshok Van, Dahisar East, Mumbai | 2 Bath(s) | Unfurnished | East | 6 Yrs\n\n1.90 Cr.\n\n[City Home Associates](https://www.realestateindia.com/profile/city-home-associates-in-borivali-east-mumbai-1041067/)\n\nContact\n\nSorry!!!Presently No property available for RENT in **Dhruv Tara Chs**\n\nWe will notify you when similar property is available for RENT.[Yes Inform Me](https://www.realestateindia.com/buy/requirement.php)\n\n## Unit Configuration\n\n| Unit Type | Area | Price (in ) | Floor Plan |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 BHK+2T | 725 Sq.ft. (Carpet) | 1.90 Cr. |  |\n\n## About Dhruv Tara Chs\n\nDhruv Tara CHS is strategically located at Borivali East with a seamless connectivity to the prominent areas of Mumbai. Spanning across 2 Acre, the project is well-spaced out. This project has a total [...read more](javascript:void(0);)\n\n### About Dhruv Tara Chs\n\nAbout Dhruv Tara Chs\n\nDhruv Tara CHS is strategically located at Borivali East with a seamless connectivity to the prominent areas of Mumbai. Spanning across 2 Acre, the project is well-spaced out. This project has a total of 80 units. The project is smartly constructed, and all the units are Ready To Move. Smartly planned, the complex has a total of 2 towers.\n\n## Amenities\n\n* ![Park](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/park.jpg)\n\n  Park\n* ![Play Area](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/play-area.jpg)\n\n  Play Area\n* ![Reserved Parking](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/reserved-parking.jpg)\n\n  Reserved Parking\n* ![Security](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/security.jpg)\n\n  Security\n* ![Water Storage](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/water-storage.jpg)\n\n  Water Storage\n* ![Waste Disposal](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/waste-disposal.jpg)\n\n  Waste Disposal\n\n[Show All](javascript:void(0);)\n\n### Amenities\n\n* ![Park](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/park.jpg)\n\n  Park\n* ![Play Area](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/play-area.jpg)\n\n  Play Area\n* ![Reserved Parking](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/reserved-parking.jpg)\n\n  Reserved Pa